  "annotation": "Sammlung von 20 Beiträgen INr 40886-40905, Obj 23-43 /) II. Tafeln am Wege (Sammlung INr 40884, Obj 22) Der Sammlung vorangestellt: Of Orpheus now no more let poets tell, / To bright Cecilia greater pow'r is giv'n; / His numbers rais'd a shade from hell, / Her's lift the soul to heav'n. / POPE",
